"description": "Reliance Worldwide Corp. Ltd. engages in the water technology business. The firm's activities include the design, manufacture, and distribution of branded water flow and control products and solutions for the plumbing industry. Its products include fittings and pipes, control valves, thermostatic products, water meters, underfloor and radiant heating control components, plastic extrusion products, and fire protection system products. It operates through the following geographical segments: Americas, Asia Pacific, and EMEA. The Americas geographical segments include the United States of America and Canada. The Asia Pacific geographical segments manage the business operation in Australia, New Zealand, Korea, and China. The EMEA geographical segments deals with the United Kingdom, Germany, Spain, Italy, Poland, France, and Czech Republic. The company was founded in 1949 and is headquartered in Atlanta, GA.",
